At the 120h headline lead, adding adaln to the knee changes balance by -0.01548 (+2.96% removed) and conservation by +0.00175 (-0.84%).

Interpretation. A near-zero change is the EXPECTED result and confirms the film<->adaln correspondence as measured rather than predicted -- adaln leads Frontier B's cost-sorted order because it is nearly free, not because protecting it helps. Never write 'protecting adaln removes damage'. A large change would instead falsify pre-registration clause 2 on Stormer, which is a finding in its own right and must be reported as such.

